 real culprit who planned to assassinate Empress Wu was tracked down, and a fight between the Tang Dynasty and Tuyuhun was prevented. war between", "startDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 11}, "endDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 11}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 66, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Adventure", "Fantasy"], "tags": [{"name": "Full CGI", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 176864, "title": {"romaji": "Xing Qia Meng Shao Nu 1 Hua Yu Bi Ji", "english": "Shining Cardsprites"}, "format": "TV_SHORT", "description": null, "startDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 11}, "endDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 11}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 40, "duration": 8, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Mahou Shoujo", "Slice of Life"], "tags": [{"name": "Magic", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Henshin", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Primarily Female Cast", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Female Protagonist", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 176880, "title": {"romaji": "Ensoku Datta Hi", "english": null}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "Graduate work 2022, Musashino Art University, Department of Film and New Media. \n<br><br>\n(Source: Eizo100)", "startDate": {"year": 2023, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 2023, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 5, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": [{"name": "CGI", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 176881, "title": {"romaji": "Tsuru ga Mau Yoru ni", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "Part of the Young Animator Training Project. One of the shorts exhibited in Anime no Tane 2023.", "startDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 3}, "endDate": {"year": 2023, "month": 3}, "season": "WINTER", "seasonYear": 2023, "episodes": 1, "duration": 10, "countryOfOrigi